   "text": "What can you do at an inn?\n\nWell when you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably.  Because of this, you will become \"well rested\" much more quickly than you would in the wilderness.  When you are well rested, you learn more from experience.\n\nYou may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn.",
