   "source": "community",
   "text": "Mining isn't the most glamorous, but it's good honest work and a fine profession for you to explore.\r\n\r\nI reckon I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Lodestone for your camp. Build one of these and everyone who wants to swing a sword will be eager to gather round your fire and soak up the extra \"oomph\" it can provide to increase their combat prowess.",
